 =?UTF-8?q?CZOS)=20+=20contenido=20ceremonial=20(Sello=20de=20Aethon,=20Po?=
 =?UTF-8?q?lvo=20Estelar,=20Empoderamiento=20C=C3=B3smico)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Mejoras profesionales sobre baseline estable v5.27 (sin tocar la lÃ³gica del Grimorio):

A. Texturas regeneradas en alta calidad:
   - 14 texturas items/projectiles/buffs/tile/icon (subagent A)
   - 6 texturas NPCs (subagent B)
   - 3 texturas nuevo contenido (subagent C)
   - Workflow: z-ai image 1024x1024 master -> PIL LANCZOS downscale
   - Background transparency via most-common-border-color detection
   - Maestros preservados en Content/_masters/

B. Nuevo contenido ceremonial:
   - StellarDust.cs (material cÃ³smico, recetas + drops en NPCs)
   - AethonSigil.cs (accesorio: +5% magic/summon, +1 minion, +5 mana regen)
   - CosmicEmpowermentBuff.cs (+10% dmg, +5% crit, +5% atk speed, 1% lifesteal)
   - Drops: AethonBoss 10-15, HollowTitan 5-8, RiftKeeper 3-5, Echoes 25% x 1-2

C. Cambios de cÃ³digo:
   - ShardPlayer.cs: HasCosmicEmpowerment flag + ResetEffects
   - GlobalNPCXP.cs: ApplyCosmicEmpowermentLifesteal + StellarDust drops
   - Localization ES/EN: 6 claves nuevas

D. Seguridad:
   - Tag stable-pre-improvements-v5.27 (baseline restaurable)
   - Rama stable-pre-improvements-v5.27-backup

Version bump: 5.27 -> 5.28
